      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 106398822,
      "text": "セイタカヨシ Phragmites karka (Retz.) Trib. ex Steud. はイネ科の植物の1つ。広く知られるヨシに似たもので、より背が高くなり、小穂はむしろ小さい。"
    },
    "en": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (en): Phragmites karka",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Phragmites_karka",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 1337162944,
      "text": "Phragmites karka, the tall reed or common reed, is a species of flowering plant in the grass family. It is native to West Africa."
    },
    "fr": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (fr): Phragmites karka",
      "source_url": "https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Phragmites_karka",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 177716051,
      "text": "Phragmites karka est une espèce de roseaux asiatique de la famille des Poaceae. Elle pousse dans les savanes humides d'Afrique, d'Asie et d'Australie."
    },
    "id": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (id): Perumpung",
